# The cloud machine's image a checkout's build deploys: ghcr.io/<owner>/ky-cloud@sha256:<digest>,
# after "# source: <commit>", the commit it was built from. `pnpm compile` puts it in release.json
# when it builds no release (no KY_VERSION): a local `ky deploy`, and deploy.yml. A release doesn't
# need it: .github/workflows/release.yml keeps the image the newest release deploys, or builds one,
# and only falls back to this when no release names an image. Its summary, and image.yml's, print
# the lines to put here.
# source: aca5dce162477b9c99a605598f65d4f6ef36a7b2
ghcr.io/yeshwanthyk/ky-cloud@sha256:63136bcd3d64e4aea68ea81826765400df0c0f3cd6f12a3b20d3501ae147e80c
